{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261021/photo/bkn-20261021193158232-1021_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261021202216\"/><p>今日(21日)傍晚6時09分，執法部門接獲一名女子報案，指其姓吳(50歲)丈夫在將軍澳佳景路9號浩明苑的住所房間暈倒。救護員上門協助，惜當場證實吳男死亡。消息指，事主生前患有身體病，稍後會驗屍確定他的死因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T14:22:24.571333+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T11:31:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T14:57:54.247524+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T14:17:52.791391+00:00","content_hash":"21bde0e4116beb76d61a9cc52c70673400ec321ae6f8b96239055d8104ae27ba","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}